#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0084 expect=violation domain=ADSL
#note "Combined review of runbook W2-W8, XCUT H1 (red-before on the pre-fix engine: 0 findings). The rows' maxima DIFFER: row 1's is 21000 (equal to its TRTEDT, clean), row 2's is 21500 (its TRTEDT 21000 is not the max: fires). With $trxx_max read from row 0 for every row, row 2 compared 21000 against 21000 and was silent, and any finding would have reported row 0's maximum. The pin asserts the row AND the reported per-row maximum."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 USUBJID=01-002 "$trxx_max"=21500
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col TRTEDT   type=Num
col TR01EDT  type=Num
col TR02EDT  type=Num
---
S1 | 01-001 | 21000 | 21000 | 20990
S1 | 01-002 | 21000 | 21500 | 20990
---
